                <head>No. 439<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1954-02-07">February 7, 1954</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>According to the records of the United States Delegation, with the exception of
                    the events described in Dulte 47, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>, no
                    meetings took place on Sunday, February 7. However Secretary Dulles held a press
                    conference that afternoon at which he responded to questions concerning the
                    progress of the meetings. The full text of the press conference was transmitted
                    in Secto 103 from Berlin, February 8. (Conference files, lot 60 D 627, CF
                    210)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
